/// ngspice's crossings (sar_logic_ref.cir), ps: Valid rising and falling (eleven pulses), clks falling, CK11 .. CK1 rising, clkc rising and falling.
pub const SL_NG_TV : [11]usize = [80100, 120100, 160100, 200100, 240100, 280100, 320100, 360100, 400100, 440100, 480100];
